{"id":4123,"date":"2025-06-05T08:19:37","date_gmt":"2025-06-05T08:19:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4123"},"modified":"2025-08-16T01:48:26","modified_gmt":"2025-08-16T01:48:26","slug":"tiktok-shop-partner-la-gi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/tiktok-shop-partner-la-gi\/","title":{"rendered":"TikTok Shop Partner l\u00e0 g\u00ec? L\u1ee3i \u00edch v\u00e0 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i khi kinh doanh"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"ID4SdY7ENoretZxKIu5lMYGNgjd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2G4d7nDeoJOa1xrAuulImADgtg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Shop Partner l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok c\u00f4ng nh\u1eadn, chuy\u00ean h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng, v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh thu tr\u00ean TikTok Shop. T\u1eeb thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf gian h\u00e0ng, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, \u0111\u1ebfn chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng \u2013 c\u00e1c Partner s\u1ebd \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh tr\u1ecdn g\u00f3i c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n. C\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a> xem ngay, \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft th\u00eam chi ti\u1ebft.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HW0ydYb7qoZAVexTdDKlBJ3hghb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Tiktok Shop Partner l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fv4Md5TURo9T94xThoTl70Bagcb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>TikTok Shop Partner (TSP)<\/strong> l\u00e0 c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c TikTok c\u1ea5p quy\u1ec1n nh\u1eb1m h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh kinh doanh tr\u00ean TikTok Shop. H\u1ecd cung c\u1ea5p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng, x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c kinh doanh, k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi KOL\/KOC, s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o. Vi\u1ec7c h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi TikTok Shop Partner gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian, n\u00e2ng cao hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p h\u01a1n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4128\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4128\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4128\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-10.png\" alt=\"TikTok Shop Partner\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-10.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-10-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-10-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-10-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-10-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4128\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok Shop Partner<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N40gdFT4kobuW2xA25ilCbNGgfb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"ID4SdY7ENoretZxKIu5lMYGNgjd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NvZbdaux4oCh4XxT4qsleKESgBD\" style=\"text-align: left;\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn tham gia TikTok Shop Partner<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SWprdPg4CoJfRsxehsBlkpRigxd\">\u0110\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t TikTok Shop Partner, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc sau:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-CVtrduI2WoQ1fLxEhVplavbrgdO\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. \u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dr8OdaHXsosITFxpdC3lDZLVgPd\">Truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o trang ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a TikTok Shop Partner v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c \u201c\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd\u201d. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng email ho\u1eb7c s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-BTDKd6hQeob5A0xMnZllFjm3gah\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. T\u1ea1o h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K0E6dQG1Oou2VKxLaY8ldd3qgkf\">Sau khi \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n \u0111i\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 th\u00f4ng tin doanh nghi\u1ec7p bao g\u1ed3m: t\u00ean c\u00f4ng ty, \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9, l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng, lo\u1ea1i h\u00ecnh d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 cung c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-BFRldYHC5o7miRx6gFPlCu3Bgdc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. X\u00e1c minh th\u00f4ng tin<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GLfXdRMu7or9EuxXJ4Klq5f0goh\">TikTok s\u1ebd y\u00eau c\u1ea7u b\u1ea1n x\u00e1c minh \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 email v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\u00ednh x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c. Ngo\u00e0i ra, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 c\u1ea7n n\u1ed9p m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn ph\u00e1p l\u00fd ho\u1eb7c n\u0103ng l\u1ef1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OCz9dcCCCoqdeZxqVUClwU4Ngpe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KxS3d9Ftvoz6zAxl60AlEI5Tgkc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u01a1 h\u1ed9i khi tham gia kinh doanh tr\u00ean Tiktok shop<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C5J7dnO81omtMXxqii8lgT0ng9c\">M\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y TikTok c\u00f3 h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng, gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng lan t\u1ecfa v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u00e8n link s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ngay trong video ho\u1eb7c livestream, gi\u00fap kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng mua h\u00e0ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng r\u1eddi kh\u1ecfi \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng. Kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n t\u1ed1n nhi\u1ec1u chi ph\u00ed cho m\u1eb7t b\u1eb1ng hay qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng, v\u1eabn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t doanh thu cao nh\u1edd n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K6P7dXQ0roiWBrx4jHrlJ2wcgrd\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n c\u00f2n c\u00f3 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung, KOL\/KOC \u0111\u1ec3 gia t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh s\u1ed1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. V\u1edbi chi ph\u00ed th\u1ea5p, kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng cao v\u00e0 ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng tr\u1ebb, TikTok Shop l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho nh\u1eefng ai mu\u1ed1n b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u ho\u1eb7c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kinh doanh online.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4126\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4126\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4126\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-2.png\" alt=\"C\u01a1 h\u1ed9i ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng tr\u1ebb, t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh thu v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i. \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4126\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u01a1 h\u1ed9i ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng tr\u1ebb, t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh thu v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"ID4SdY7ENoretZxKIu5lMYGNgjd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"ID4SdY7ENoretZxKIu5lMYGNgjd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KkKBd3W1Kol0wbxLumtlsPl0gRd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WviEdUMFUoWHIUxv8vElJgpNgdD\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1c Lo\u1ea1i TikTok Shop Partner<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jf4ZdoMK6oSphXxTb4kluI5NgLc\">Trong h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i TikTok Shop, c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c (TikTok Shop Partner \u2013 TSP) \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chia th\u00e0nh nhi\u1ec1u lo\u1ea1i d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean vai tr\u00f2 v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 h\u1ecd cung c\u1ea5p. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng nh\u00f3m ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn nh\u1ea5t:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-YizWdTlceozOGtxWtg7lOYa3gMf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Nh\u00e0 cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 (TSP)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZithdLukBoqrx6xGPUNldDVIglB\">TSP (Trusted Service Partner) l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 nh\u01b0 c\u00e1nh tay ph\u1ea3i cho c\u00e1c TikTok Shop Seller. H\u1ecd cung c\u1ea5p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 nh\u1eb1m h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh gian h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, t\u1eeb kh\u00e2u x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a kinh doanh. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt bao g\u1ed3m: thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u0103ng t\u1ea3i v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, tri\u1ec3n khai chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t follow v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c th\u00f4ng qua n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch d\u1eef li\u1ec7u kinh doanh \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c. C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 xem TSP nh\u01b0 c\u00e1c \u201c\u0111\u1ea1i l\u00fd\u201d v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, gi\u00fap nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh social commerce tr\u00ean TikTok m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ZNjjdRAyHoKDqvxyFwnlEzQHgcf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung (MCN)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WyhmdBZY4oaKGmxknn0l7NgBgpb\">MCN (Multi-Channel Network) chuy\u00ean qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i KOL\/KOC \u2013 c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung c\u00f3 s\u1ee9c \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng tr\u00ean m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i. MCN \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 l\u00e0 c\u1ea7u n\u1ed1i gi\u1eefa nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng, gi\u00fap x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 th\u00f4ng qua c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 quay video qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1, review s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c livestream b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung ng\u1eafn h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn. Nh\u1edd v\u00e0o kinh nghi\u1ec7m trong vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd KOL\/KOC v\u00e0 hi\u1ec3u bi\u1ebft s\u00e2u s\u1eafc v\u1ec1 h\u00e0nh vi ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng, MCN gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 ph\u1ee7, th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 gia t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G4ZddFHeQofmcwxEuRFlQ5L6g2e\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-QezOdMsCvoPjzMx0nXnlOGD5gqd\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Nh\u1eefng ti\u00eau ch\u00ed l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn TikTok Shop Partner ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QebVdYRb8oGU9ZxiViZlG9AGgad\">\u0110\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 kinh doanh tr\u00ean TikTok Shop, vi\u1ec7c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang TikTok Shop Partner l\u00e0 r\u1ea5t quan tr\u1ecdng. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ti\u00eau ch\u00ed c\u1ea7n xem x\u00e9t:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JOMHdZ6spowV7SxZ4aXlXCWag9f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Kinh nghi\u1ec7m v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean m\u00f4n: <\/strong>\u01afu ti\u00ean \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u00f3 kinh nghi\u1ec7m th\u1ef1c chi\u1ebfn trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c b\u1ea1n \u0111ang kinh doanh, am hi\u1ec3u h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng TikTok v\u00e0 t\u1eebng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nhi\u1ec1u th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L6Ird4Y3HoiD6qxagrllgo4vgge\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 cung c\u1ea5p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng v\u00e0 linh ho\u1ea1t:<\/strong> Ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cung c\u1ea5p nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh gian h\u00e0ng, livestream, marketing, x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n,&#8230; v\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh theo nhu c\u1ea7u c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DaZ5dHjUHoyU3yxdeUtlqH9YgXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ed9i ng\u0169 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nhanh ch\u00f3ng: <\/strong>M\u1ed9t \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i nhanh, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nhi\u1ec7t t\u00ecnh s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi v\u00e0 y\u00ean t\u00e2m h\u01a1n khi h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c l\u00e2u d\u00e0i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TkHUd8G1Poy3lbxtnSglRy8Igkf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Feedback v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u1eeb kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng kh\u00e1c:<\/strong> Doanh nghi\u1ec7p n\u00ean t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u \u00fd ki\u1ebfn, \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eebng h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u0111\u00f3. Nh\u1eefng ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i n\u00e0y s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 c\u00e1i nh\u00ecn kh\u00e1ch quan h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, c\u00e1ch l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c, c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf m\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c mang l\u1ea1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4127\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4127\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4127\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-1.png\" alt=\"M\u1ea3nh gh\u00e9p chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00fap v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh TikTok Shop hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4127\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">M\u1ea3nh gh\u00e9p chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00fap v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh TikTok Shop hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SH4pdwOXIoc6e5xLTjPlRC2ogCg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WdIidW2A3oeJyGxOHdvlGy2ogMe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Vai tr\u00f2 c\u1ee7a TikTok Shop Partner<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HlbfdXGNMoSJByxLyOLlTWNVgcg\">TikTok Shop Partner \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 trung gian quan tr\u1ecdng trong h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i TikTok Shop, gi\u00fap c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kinh doanh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng. C\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, h\u1ecd h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1eeb kh\u00e2u v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh gian h\u00e0ng, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u quy tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c marketing v\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung nh\u01b0 KOL, KOC \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. Nh\u1edd c\u00f3 TikTok Shop Partner, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian, n\u00e2ng cao hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng t\u1ea7m \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng s\u1ed1. H\u1ecd c\u0169ng gi\u00fap \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o vi\u1ec7c tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok, gi\u1ea3m thi\u1ec3u r\u1ee7i ro khi kinh doanh tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HfV4d9lZwoQRPexcIftl88IXgFf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HCrZdCPacooYPQxsEPFlHE4RgLg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt m\u00e0 TikTok Shop Partner cung c\u1ea5p<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4124\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4124\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4124\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-2.png\" alt=\"\u0110\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n tr\u00ean TikTok Shop.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/32-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4124\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n tr\u00ean TikTok Shop.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"ID4SdY7ENoretZxKIu5lMYGNgjd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-WfcNdtvxhoChCHxDNtDlO2UwgHf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi KOL\/KOC<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TBbTdvlLtojDWdxk2bqlTs1Jgjb\">TikTok Shop Partner gi\u00fap nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm v\u00e0 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi c\u00e1c KOL, KOC ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. Theo th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea, c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 tham gia c\u1ee7a KOL\/KOC c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn l\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn 60% v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i mua h\u00e0ng l\u00ean 30%, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u gia t\u0103ng uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 doanh s\u1ed1.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-UTO4d9OHNoRG1wxVHGAlHI5rgVh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c kinh doanh<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hwrudyv6RoaCVbxVa5WlanySgeg\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c s\u1ebd t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p v\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c kinh doanh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean TikTok Shop, bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1ch x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng gian h\u00e0ng, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u n\u1ed9i dung, qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1. C\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh thu t\u1eeb 20-50% trong 3 th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea7u. Chi ph\u00ed t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eeb 5 tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ebfn 20 tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed3ng\/th\u00e1ng, t\u00f9y theo ph\u1ea1m vi v\u00e0 m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-KygkdzZBeo7SoUxo7IVlXYOWghh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u00e1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch.<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TfFzd9YhLo3qWTxU0LvlvY3JgGD\">Khi g\u1eb7p s\u1ef1 c\u1ed1 li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c s\u1ebd h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 x\u1eed l\u00fd v\u00e0 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c, gi\u1ea3m t\u1edbi 80% r\u1ee7i ro b\u1ecb kh\u00f3a gian h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf ch\u1ee9c n\u0103ng. D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh theo g\u00f3i h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ho\u1eb7c theo s\u1ef1 c\u1ed1, v\u1edbi m\u1ee9c ph\u00ed linh ho\u1ea1t t\u00f9y v\u00e0o m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p c\u1ee7a v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S3NcdkzWBo0Az8xcDYil8ETzgaf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-QLcBdmY8cojvRTxKD6Xl5CQJgWe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f278b50a-10a1-48fc-8ecb-538205facf43&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:192,&quot;width&quot;:192,&quot;currHeight&quot;:192,&quot;currWidth&quot;:192,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:600,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.32,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQOEebxwmooVebfxnHVwlIiEVg9b%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QOEebxwmooVebfxnHVwlIiEVg9b&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:51803,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JiWNd0Nwpoz6awxilhwlaXTJgOd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u